<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-each-element-multiple-functions> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Choose and place each element in a design so that it performs as many functions as possible. Beneficial connections between diverse components create a stable whole. Stack elements in both space and time." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
