<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#order> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#source> "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 7." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#jeffReading> "Jeff's best ideas come in the margins — the 'what if' during a demo, the story dropped between cards, the side comment that reshapes a roadmap." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#techReading> "Seams between roles generate patterns. Margin of the spec produces new cards. The Clearing IS an edge between roles. Demo seeds — Jeff's reactions to live work — are the highest-signal intake channel." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#label> "Optimize edge" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#comment> "The edge — the intersection of two environments — is where resources and interactions are highest. A productive edge is where the most diversity and productivity are found." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-optimize-edge> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#ownedBy> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#principal-wren> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
