<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#order> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#source> "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 6." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#jeffReading> "Jeff cards a tiny fix rather than a big reorg when he can. Prefers a pattern learned over a pattern imposed." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#techReading> "Ship small, narrow blast radius, bounded services, deploy rings. Smallest card that teaches, not largest card that ships. Chunking: a practice that works becomes a skill; a skill that works becomes a primitive." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#label> "Use small-scale, intensive systems" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#comment> "Start at your doorstep with the smallest systems that will do the job and build on your successes. Grow by 'chunking' — that is, developing a small system or arrangement that works well — and then add it to another one." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#ownedBy> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#principal-wren> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#principal-wren> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-08T16:13:49Z" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Start at your doorstep with the smallest systems that will do the job and build on your successes. Grow by 'chunking' — that is, developing a small system or arrangement that works well — and then add it to another one." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Use small-scale, intensive systems" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-small-scale-intensive-systems> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Principle> <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
