<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-creativity-is-the-limit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The designer's imagination and skill usually limit productivity and diversity before any physical limits are reached." <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hemenway-creativity-is-the-limit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The biggest limit to abundance is creativity" <urn:chorus:domains:principles> .
